question_en:
In the program below, y is a positive integer (e.g. l, 2, 3, ...).
 result ← 0
 REPEAT 3 TIMES {
 REPEAT y TIMES {
 result ← result + 1
 }
 }

question_ha:
A cikin shirin da ke ƙasa, y shine madaidaicin lamba (misali l, 2, 3, ...).
 sakamako ← 0
 MAIMAITA SAU UKU {
 Maimaita y LOKUTTAN {
 sakamako ← sakamako + 1
 }
 }

